# The KPI Hub — .htaccess for Hostinger
# SECURITY: This file contains SetEnv directives for server-side secrets.
# NEVER commit this file to GitHub. Deploy manually to Hostinger.
# Reference: .deploy-exclude marks this as SERVER-ONLY protected during rsync.

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
